    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "these commands. A word like लब्ध should be supplied in the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "first line. अशन would probably be a better reading than आसन.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "मान = honour. घटन = constituted by—“the enjoyments consisting",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "in” &c.—Râmarshi renders it by योजना. नित्योदित = ever existing,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "not transient like the enjoyments referred to. परमात्मज्ञानरूप says",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "Râmarshi. Comp. St. 76.—S'ârdûlavikrîḍita.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXXI.—सर्गग्रामकुटी &c. comp. Gîtâ II., 42 et seq. कर्मक्रिया-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "विभ्रम = the sports of the performance of rites and cere-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "monies रचना = प्राप्तिः (Râmarshi.); literally arrangement i. e. the ap-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "pointment of trouble as attaining to each act of life, substantially",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "it means large extent, expanse. स्वात्मानन्दपदप्रवेशकलन = the compass-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "ing of entrance into that seat where there is joy in oneself.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "स्वात्मानन्द एव परमानन्द एव पदं वस्तु तत्र प्रवेशकळनं अनुभवधारणम् (Râmarshi).",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "वणिग्वृत्ति = mercenary, shop-keeping.—S'ârdûlavikrîḍita.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "LXXXII.—संकल्पकल्प = momentary like thought; for कल्प see",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Siddh. Kaum. I., 704. पूर the more usual word is ओघ. कण्ठाश्लेषोपगूढम्—",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "Râmarshi says कण्ठस्य गलस्याश्लेषः वल्गनं यथा स्यात्तथा उपगूढमालिङ्गनम्",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "which is nearly correct. It is an instance of the so-called णमुल्.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "कण्ठाश्लेषं यथा स्यात्तथा उपगूढम्. See Siddh. Kaum. I., 474. The compound",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "may be also analysed in a different way and उपगूढम् may be",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "rendered by आलिङ्गन see Siddh. Kaum. I., 454.—Sragdharâ.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXXIII.—मण्डली is the same as मण्डल. This particular",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "form is authorized by the Gaṇa at Siddh. Kaum. I., 227, but for",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "the similar पटली, and कपाली, I know of no authority. The last",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "line is a question.—Anushṭub.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXXIV.—संस्कार = operation, effect. समीभूता = निर्विकल्पेत्यर्थः",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "(Râmarshi.) It means however, equable, looking on all things",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "alike. Comp. Raghu VIII., 24 (Mallinâtha); and Bhagavadgîtâ",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "V., 18 and VI. 8, 9, 29 and various other places. The Stanza",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "occurs at p. 317 of the Kâvyasangraha.—S'ikhariṇî.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
